LookML parser (vendored)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The package mondrian.lookml.parse (and its sub-package mondrian.lookml.parse.util)
contains a vendored and modified copy of the generic LookML parser from the
"lookml" project:

    Julian Hyde / LookML Authors
    https://github.com/hydromatic/lookml
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Files originating from that project retain their original Apache-2.0 license
headers. They have been re-packaged from net.hydromatic.lookml(.parse|.util)
into mondrian.lookml.parse(.util) and trimmed/patched for the LookML-to-Mondrian
M4 importer (issue #98):

  * Only the generic push parser, its event handlers (ObjectHandler,
    ListHandler), the value model (Value, ValueImpl, Values), positions (Pos,
    Source, Sources) and the PairList utilities (PairList, ImmutablePairList,
    PairLists, MapEntry, Nullness) were vendored.
  * The Calcite / SQL / MiniLookml / Facade / schema-validation / writer /
    logging layers were NOT vendored.
  * src/main/javacc/mondrian/lookml/LookmlParser.jj is a patched copy of the
    upstream grammar; the three applied patches are documented in that file.

